ınnış kanlardan tercihen kan ürünleri imali cihetine gidilme-","x0":0.21560574264016927,"x1":0.8172484666000771,"top":0.6119186045259511,"bottom":0.6235465117491229,"conf":1},{"text":"melidir.","x0":0.19096509318539387,"x1":0.25872689839571494,"top":0.6293604649698096,"bottom":0.6409883721929812,"conf":0.5},{"text":"b)AIDS konusunda donörlerde dikkat edilmesi gereken hususlar: Eğer bir","x0":0.22172380344819745,"x1":0.8008770281118915,"top":0.643698822528853,"bottom":0.6580548553323803,"conf":1},{"text":"donörde;","x0":0.1902322504657977,"x1":0.25965778030556824,"top":0.6603190290184203,"bottom":0.6749276942238949,"conf":0.5},{"text":"I-'leri derecede gece terlemesi,","x0":0.22163929430432694,"x1":0.4949939687854617,"top":0.6786104907555891,"bottom":0.6919641613159857,"conf":1},{"text":"II-Sebebi bilinmeyen ateş,","x0":0.21335192818692214,"x1":0.4314428296828222,"top":0.6953637542830696,"bottom":0.7088255091553183,"conf":1},{"text":"III-Sebebsiz kilò kaybı,","x0":0.20502822059324038,"x1":0.40715689731562743,"top":0.7049889272799261,"bottom":0.7254912948701538,"conf":1},{"text":"IV-Haleizlik,","x0":0.21331347434650408,"x1":0.32463413600892754,"top":0.7285631824319151,"bottom":0.741821105721157,"conf":1},{"text":"V-Jeneralize Lenfoaderomegali (1 aydan fazla süreli),","x0":0.2216059641357887,"x1":0.6594060475037603,"top":0.7405705522180853,"bottom":0.76024362337021,"conf":1},{"text":"( .%..)","x0":0.44147843968255607,"x1":0.49486653017370674,"top":0.7876068375044575,"bottom":0.8008720926744481,"conf":0.5},{"text":"607","x0":0.8952772069769632,"x1":0.9301848051380264,"top":0.9433139533309585,"bottom":0.9549418605541302,"conf":1}]}